{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/410976-shout-out-to-some-of-the-onyx-path-staff","id":410976,"title":"Shout Out To Some Of The Onyx Path Staff","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-18T20:45:56-08:00","id":410976,"title":"Shout Out To Some Of The Onyx Path Staff","content":"I want to give a shout out to some of the Onyx Path staff who I feel really contribute to this community in a special way!<ul><li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey\">R</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey\">ose Bailey</a> is far and away the most helpful person at Onyx Path! Every time I have talked to her she has done her very best help me find what I needed, and even when she didn't have the answer I was looking for I felt like she made a good faith effort none the less.</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall\">Neall Raemonn Price</a> is one of the most candid developers at Onyxpath. He always talks directly to the community, and answers question in a meaningful way, rarely dodging the question.</li> <li><a href=\"http://eddyfate.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Eddy Webb</a> knows how to create some genuine excitement for Onyx Path projects. It never feels like he is selling you a line, his excitement is real and that makes it all the more contagious!</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson\">Ian Watson</a> knows how to balance levity and professionalism. If you follow his twitter you would likely think he is a mad man, but he contributes to this community with a level of calm professionalism that really stands out.</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T21:44:03-08:00","id":411028,"title":"","content":"Cool folks, all. Rose Bailey is super nice and helpful; Dave Brookshaw is juggling plates all over the place; Ian Watson has some kind of omnipresence superpower he can only use on the internet. Eric Zawadski doesn't post as often, but he and David Hill both tend to share some good thoughts, plus if I recall correctly, David's been managing it through a pretty bad past year or two.<br /> <br /> My words of gratitude are not exclusive; I'm certain there are cool writerly folks I'm missing here, especially since I'm starting to run out of specific words to say besides &quot;I like your work a lot.&quot; Plus I know there have got to be newcomers to the Path whose voice I haven't picked out in the books yet but whose work I enjoyed greatly, and writers who don't have the time to be able to keep up with the many buzzing forums around (and they certainly aren't obligated to).<br /> <br /> So, don'cha know: just signal boostin' some good vibes. Spread love.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T12:32:53-08:00","id":411880,"title":"","content":"Hear, hear!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}